# Installed dependencies
node_modules/

# lib/ is deliberately NOT ignored. `main` and `exports` point at lib/index.js
# and lib/client.js, and a git-source install materialises exactly the tracked
# files: ignoring the build output means a user who installs with
# `dsh plugin add github:<owner>/dsh-imagegen-panel` gets a package whose
# declared entry artifact is missing, and dshmarket reports it as
# "the declared entry artifact is missing (source-only checkout or blocked
# build) — the next boot would fail".
#
# The build is reproducible from src/ (`npm run build`), so committing the
# output costs nothing and is what makes the GitHub install path work. Re-run
# the build before every commit that touches src/.

# Local scratch space, never part of the deliverable
.ref/
.npm-cache/
.tmp-pack/

# Development-time material: internal notes and process evidence. These carry
# this machine's absolute paths and the author's private setup, so they stay out
# of the published tree.
PLAN.md
HANDOVER-*.md
ui-mockup/
preview/
stage[0-9]-evidence/

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
